  "step_3": "The decision reason requires the evaluation of the sum of pairwise differences between outcomes of the two lotteries, which involves comparing all outcome pairs (4000 vs 3000 and 0 vs 3000) and summing their absolute differences. The individual did not consider Lottery A at all and did not mention any comparison of outcomes or their differences. The justification was based solely on the attractiveness of a certain 3000 Euros, which aligns with risk aversion or certainty preference, not with the sum of outcome differences. There is no evidence in the verbal report that the individual computed or considered any pairwise differences between outcomes. Therefore, the decision reason was not used. The assessment is certain that the reason was not applied.",
